00:20:55.850 --> 00:20:56.990
<v Richard Price>[LAUGHTER]
<v Richard Price>[笑声]

00:20:56.990 --> 00:21:02.490
<v Richard Price>And the other cop says, hey, we gave it a shot, man. That's all we can do. Thank you.
<v Richard Price>另一个警察说，嘿，我们试过了，伙计。我们只能做到这一步。谢谢。

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:07.310
