00:43:33.180 --> 00:43:48.340
<v Shalom Auslander>We lay there a while longer, holding hands in the cool tropical night breeze, watching the shimmering lights of long-dead stars and pretending we weren't listening to an old man drowning in his own phlegm.
<v Shalom Auslander>我们在清凉的热带晚风中躺了一会儿，手牵手看着早已熄灭的恒星闪烁的光芒，假装我们没有听到一个老人在自己的痰液中淹没。

00:43:48.340 --> 00:43:55.180
<v Shalom Auslander>[HACKING]
